10. She values her audience’s company and worries her voice might become annoying over time. (Verbatim: "thank you for keeping me company... i can imagine my voice getting annoying after a while.") [end of text]



1. She broke the family PC as a child while trying to find a secret Pokémon game by inserting Pokémon cards into the computer. (Verbatim: "i broke the family pc um i was a hankin menace um i was trying to help i was trying to help... putting pokemon cards inside the pc hoping to unlock a secret pokemon game")

