6. She can mimic a high-pitched whistle that communicates with marmosets and has tried it at zoos to see which animals react. (Verbatim: "i can like communicate with them with a high whistle like that... that's my high-pitched whistle it was the only whistle i could do for like the longest time.")
7. She was disappointed she couldn’t see the elephants and polar bears up close during her visit to Ueno Zoo because they were closed early. (Verbatim: "i didn't get to see the polar bear the polar bear had already been like like like put away for the day um so that was really sad.")
